body:
Improves parser support for the following types of component attributes:

```blade
<x-alert
    data-one={{ $something }}
    data-two={{{ $something }}}
    data-three={!! $something !!}
/>
```

fixes: https://github.com/keymanapp/keyman/issues/12896.

This PR is ready for reviews.

@keymanapp-test-bot skip

